{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-isa-24-1","title":"Isaiah 24:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The doleful judgments of God upon the land. 13 A remnant shall joyfully praise him. 16 God in his judgments shall advance his kingdom.</p>\n<p>A.M. 3292. B.C.712. maketh the. 1:7-9; 5:6; 6:11,12; 7:17-25; 27:10; 32:13,14; 42:15; Jer 4:7 Eze 5:14; 6:6; 12:20; 24:11; 35:14; Na 2:10; Lu 21:24 turneth it upside down. Heb. perverteth the face thereof. 29:16; 2Ki 21:13; Ps 146:9; Ac 17:6 scattereth. De 4:27; 28:64; 32:26; Ne 1:8; Jer 9:16; 40:15; 50:17; Eze 5:2 Zec 13:7-9; Jas 1:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-24-2","title":"Isaiah 24:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>as with the people. 2:9; 3:2-8; 5:15; 9:14-17; 2Ch 36:14-17,20; Jer 5:3-6; 23:11-13 Jer 41:2; 42:18; 44:11-13; 52:24-30; La 4:13; 5:12-14; Eze 7:12,13 Eze 14:8-10; Da 9:5-8; Ho 4:9; Eph 6:8,9 priest. or, prince. Ge 41:50; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-24-3","title":"Isaiah 24:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>shall. 1; 6:11; Le 26:30-35; De 29:23,28; 2Ch 36:21; Eze 36:4 the Lord. 21:17; 22:25; Jer 13:15; Mic 4:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-24-4","title":"Isaiah 24:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>mourneth. 3:26; 28:1; 33:9; 64:6; Jer 4:28; 12:4; Ho 4:3 haughty people. Heb. height of the people. 2:11,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-24-5","title":"Isaiah 24:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>defiled. Ge 3:17,18; 6:11-13; Le 18:24-28; 20:22; Nu 35:33,34; 2Ch 33:9 Ps 106:36-39; Jer 3:1,2; Eze 7:20-24; 22:24-31; Mic 2:10 Ro 8:20,21 becau